3. How does it execute?
Execution flow
1. Outer loop – i = 1

   Inner loop executes 3 times (j = 1, 2, 3).
2. Outer loop – i = 2

   Inner loop executes another 3 times (j = 1, 2, 3).
3. Outer loop – i = 3

   Inner loop executes another 3 times (j = 1, 2, 3).
4. Outer loop terminates

   i becomes 4, so the condition i <= 3 becomes False.